471\\\">Jet Ski Rentals in St. Petersburg, FL \\u2014 From $100<\\\/strong><\\\/h1>\\n<p data-start=\\\"473\\\" data-end=\\\"831\\\">Looking for the best <strong data-start=\\\"494\\\" data-end=\\\"540\\\">jet ski rentals in St. Petersburg, Florida<\\\/strong>? Ride premium jet skis through crystal-clear coastal waters with experienced local operators. Whether you\\u2019re visiting St. Pete or a local looking for an unforgettable day on the water, our jet ski rentals and guided adventures deliver excitement, safety, and value \\u2014 no experience required.<\\\/p>\\n<p data-start=\\\"833\\\" data-end=\\\"901\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"833\\\" data-end=\\\"901\\\">Instant online booking \\u2022 Mobile friendly \\u2022 Same-day availability<\\\/strong><\\\/p>\\n<hr data-start=\\\"941\\\" data-end=\\\"944\\\">\\n<h2 data-start=\\\"946\\\" data-end=\\\"1003\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"949\\\" data-end=\\\"1003\\\">Jet Ski Rental Pricing \\u2014 Affordable Rates From $100<\\\/strong><\\\/h2>\\n<p data-start=\\\"1005\\\" data-end=\\\"1112\\\">We offer flexible jet ski rental options designed for beginners, experienced riders, couples, and families.<\\\/p>\\n<p data-start=\\\"1114\\\" data-end=\\\"1146\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1114\\\" data-end=\\\"1146\\\">Our jet ski rentals include:<\\\/strong><\\\/p>\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1147\\\" data-end=\\\"1324\\\">\\n<li data-start=\\\"1147\\\" data-end=\\\"1178\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1149\\\" data-end=\\\"1178\\\">Rentals starting <strong data-start=\\\"1166\\\" data-end=\\\"1178\\\">from $100<\\\/strong><\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"1179\\\" data-end=\\\"1219\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1181\\\" data-end=\\\"1219\\\">Hourly rentals and guided tour options<\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"1220\\\" data-end=\\\"1252\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1222\\\" data-end=\\\"1252\\\">Fuel included \\u2014 no hidden fees<\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"1253\\\" data-end=\\\"1288\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1255\\\" data-end=\\\"1288\\\">Premium, well-maintained jet skis<\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"1289\\\" data-end=\\\"1324\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1291\\\" data-end=\\\"1324\\\">Safety briefing before every ride<\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<\\\/ul>\\n<p data-start=\\\"1326\\\" data-end=\\\"1476\\\">Whether you want to explore on your own or follow a scenic guided route through islands and coastal waters, we have an option that fits your schedule.<\\\/p>\\n<hr data-start=\\\"1478\\\" data-end=\\\"1481\\\">\\n<h2 data-start=\\\"1483\\\" data-end=\\\"1530\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1486\\\" data-end=\\\"1530\\\">Why Choose Our St. Pete Jet Ski Rentals?<\\\/strong><\\\/h2>\\n<p data-start=\\\"1532\\\" data-end=\\\"1617\\\">We\\u2019re proud to be one of the most trusted jet ski rental operators in St. Petersburg.<\\\/p>\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1619\\\" data-end=\\\"1842\\\">\\n<li data-start=\\\"1619\\\" data-end=\\\"1661\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1621\\\" data-end=\\\"1661\\\">\\u2b50 <strong data-start=\\\"1623\\\" data-end=\\\"1661\\\">5-Star Rated by Hundreds of Riders<\\\/strong><\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"1662\\\" data-end=\\\"1705\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1664\\\" data-end=\\\"1705\\\">\\ud83d\\udedf <strong data-start=\\\"1667\\\" data-end=\\\"1705\\\">Beginner-Friendly &amp; Safety Focused<\\\/strong><\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"1706\\\" data-end=\\\"1751\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1708\\\" data-end=\\\"1751\\\">\\ud83d\\udccd <strong data-start=\\\"1711\\\" data-end=\\\"1751\\\">Locally Owned &amp; Operated in St. Pete<\\\/strong><\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"1752\\\" data-end=\\\"1805\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1754\\\" data-end=\\\"1805\\\">\\ud83c\\udfdd\\ufe0f <strong data-start=\\\"1758\\\" data-end=\\\"1805\\\">Scenic Routes Through Islands &amp; Gulf Waters<\\\/strong><\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"1806\\\" data-end=\\\"1842\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1808\\\" data-end=\\\"1842\\\">\\ud83d\\udcf1 <strong data-start=\\\"1811\\\" data-end=\\\"1842\\\">Fast, Secure Online Booking<\\\/strong><\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<\\\/ul>\\n<p data-start=\\\"1844\\\" data-end=\\\"1922\\\">Our experienced team makes sure every ride is safe, smooth, and unforgettable.<\\\/p>\\n<hr data-start=\\\"1924\\\" data-end=\\\"1927\\\">\\n<h2 data-start=\\\"1929\\\" data-end=\\\"1975\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1932\\\" data-end=\\\"1975\\\">Jet Ski Rentals vs Guided Jet Ski Tours<\\\/strong><\\\/h2>\\n<p data-start=\\\"1977\\\" data-end=\\\"2020\\\">Not sure which experience is right for you?<\\\/p>\\n<h3 data-start=\\\"2022\\\" data-end=\\\"2045\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2026\\\" data-end=\\\"2045\\\">Jet Ski Rentals<\\\/strong><\\\/h3>\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2046\\\" data-end=\\\"2141\\\">\\n<li data-start=\\\"2046\\\" data-end=\\\"2069\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"2048\\\" data-end=\\\"2069\\\">Ride at your own pace<\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"2070\\\" data-end=\\\"2113\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"2072\\\" data-end=\\\"2113\\\">Ideal for confident or experienced riders<\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"2114\\\" data-end=\\\"2141\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"2116\\\" data-end=\\\"2141\\\">Flexible rental durations<\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<\\\/ul>\\n<h3 data-start=\\\"2143\\\" data-end=\\\"2171\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2147\\\" data-end=\\\"2171\\\">Guided Jet Ski Tours<\\\/strong><\\\/h3>\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2172\\\" data-end=\\\"2293\\\">\\n<li data-start=\\\"2172\\\" data-end=\\\"2205\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"2174\\\" data-end=\\\"2205\\\">Led by experienced local guides<\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"2206\\\" data-end=\\\"2248\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"2208\\\" data-end=\\\"2248\\\">Island hopping and scenic coastal routes<\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"2249\\\" data-end=\\\"2293\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"2251\\\" data-end=\\\"2293\\\">Perfect for first-time riders and visitors<\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<\\\/ul>\\n<p data-start=\\\"2295\\\" data-end=\\\"2380\\\">Both options provide incredible views and a fun, high-energy experience on the water.<\\\/p>\\n<hr data-start=\\\"2382\\\" data-end=\\\"2385\\\">\\n<h2 data-start=\\\"2387\\\" data-end=\\\"2422\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2390\\\" data-end=\\\"2422\\\">What You\\u2019ll See on the Water<\\\/strong><\\\/h2>\\n<p data-start=\\\"2424\\\" data-end=\\\"2527\\\">Our St. Petersburg jet ski routes showcase some of Florida\\u2019s most beautiful coastal scenery, including:<\\\/p>\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2528\\\" data-end=\\\"2626\\\">\\n<li data-start=\\\"2528\\\" data-end=\\\"2555\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"2530\\\" data-end=\\\"2555\\\">Crystal-clear Gulf waters<\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"2556\\\" data-end=\\\"2585\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"2558\\\" data-end=\\\"2585\\\">Island hopping and sandbars<\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"2586\\\" data-end=\\\"2626\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"2588\\\" data-end=\\\"2626\\\">Coastal wildlife and scenic shorelines<\\\/p>\\n<\\\/li>\\n<\\\/ul>\\n<p data-start=\\\"2628\\\" data-end=\\\"2680\\\">Every ride offers a unique and memorable experience.<\\\/p>\\n<hr data-start=\\\"2682\\\" data-end=\\\"2685\\\">\\n<h2 data-start=\\\"2687\\\" data-end=\\\"2732\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2690\\\" data-end=\\\"2732\\\">Jet Ski Rental Requirements in Florida<\\\/strong><\\\/h2>\\n<p data-start=\\\"2734\\\" data-end=\\\"2832\\\">To ensure safety and compliance with Florida law, all riders must meet the following requirements.<\\\/p>\\n<h3 data-start=\\\"2834\\\" data-end=\\\"2897\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2838\\\" data-end=\\\"2897\\\">How old do you have to be to rent a jet ski in Florida?<\\\/strong><\\\/h3>\\n<p data-start=\\\"2898\\\" data-end=\\\"3128\\\">You must be <strong data-start=\\\"2910\\\" data-end=\\\"2953\\\">at least 18 years old to rent a jet ski<\\\/strong>. Riders <strong data-start=\\\"2962\\\" data-end=\\\"3078\\\">16\\u201317 years old may operate a jet ski with a parent or legal guardian present and signing the required paperwork<\\\/strong>. A safety briefing is provided before every ride.<\\\/p>\\n<h3 data-start=\\\"3130\\\" data-end=\\\"3186\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"3134\\\" data-end=\\\"3186\\\">Do I need a boating license or Boater Safety ID?<\\\/strong><\\\/h3>\\n<p data-start=\\\"3187\\\" data-end=\\\"3404\\\">Yes. <strong data-start=\\\"3192\\\" data-end=\\\"3306\\\">Anyone born on or after January 1, 1988 is required by Florida law to have a Boater Safety Identification Card<\\\/strong> to operate a jet ski. If you don\\u2019t already have one, we\\u2019ll explain your options before your ride.<\\\/p>\\n<h3 data-start=\\\"3406\\\" data-end=\\\"3451\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"3410\\\" data-end=\\\"3451\\\">Is fuel included in the rental price?<\\\/strong><\\\/h3>\\n<p data-start=\\\"3452\\\" data-end=\\\"3506\\\">Yes \\u2014 fuel is included. There are no surprise charges.<\\\/p>\\n<h3 data-start=\\\"3508\\\" data-end=\\\"3544\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"3512\\\" data-end=\\\"3544\\\">Can beginners ride jet skis?<\\\/strong><\\\/h3>\\n<p data-start=\\\"3545\\\" data-end=\\\"3653\\\">Absolutely. Our jet skis are beginner-friendly, and our team provides full instructions before you head out.<\\\/p>\\n<h3 data-start=\\\"3655\\\" data-end=\\\"3691\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"3659\\\" data-end=\\\"3691\\\">What should I bring with me?<\\\/strong><\\\/h3>\\n<p data-start=\\\"3692\\\" data-end=\\\"3756\\\">A valid photo ID, swimwear, sunscreen, and a sense of adventure.<\\\/p>\\n<hr data-start=\\\"3758\\\" data-end=\\\"3761\\\">\\n<h2 data-start=\\\"3763\\\" data-end=\\\"3826\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"3766\\\" data-end=\\\"3826\\\">Ready to Ride? Book Your Jet Ski in St. Petersburg Today<\\\/strong><\\\/h2>\\n<p data-start=\\\"3828\\\" data-end=\\\"3995\\\">Availability is limited during peak seasons and weekends. Reserve your jet ski rental in St. Petersburg now and get ready for an unforgettable experience on the water.<\\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\\/wp:paragraph --><\\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"339f309\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<!-- WaveRez widget loader (place once per page - ideally in <head>, but this works in an HTML box too) -->\\r\\n<script type=\\\"text\\\/javascript\\\" src=\\\"https:\\\/\\\/reservations.waverez.com\\\/assets\\\/dist\\\/widget\\\/js\\\/_trip_book_widget.js\\\"><\\\/script>\\r\\n\\r\\n<!-- Required overlay + popup containers (place once per page - can sit anywhere in the page HTML) -->\\r\\n<div class=\\\"waverez_overlay\\\"><\\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"waverez_popup\\\"><\\\/div>\\r\\n\\r\\n<!-- BUTTON (opens the WaveRez lightframe) -->\\r\\n<a href=\\\"#\\\"\\r\\n   data-waverez-id=\\\"1273279\\\"\\r\\n   style=\\\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\\\">\\r\\n  Check Availability &amp; Book Now\\r\\n<\\\/a>\\r\\n\\r\\n<!-- OPTIONAL: auto-open the popup when the page loads (ONLY if you want it to pop immediately) -->\\r\\n<script>\\r\\n  document.addEventListener(\\\"DOMContentLoaded\\\", function () {\\r\\n    \\\/\\\/ Set to true if you want auto-open on page load:\\r\\n    var autoOpen = false;\\r\\n\\r\\n    if (autoOpen) {\\r\\n      setTimeout(function () {\\r\\n        var btn = document.querySelector('[data-waverez-id=\\\"1273279\\\"]');\\r\\n        if (btn) btn.click();\\r\\n      }, 300);\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  });\\r\\n<\\\/script>\\r\\n\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"da57126\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\\/colors?id=accent\"}},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"f9e6d5c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\\/colors?id=accent\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"fbac01e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/xtremestpete.com\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2025\\\/12\\\/jet-ski-tour-st-petersburg-horse-conch-clear-water.jpg-scaled.jpg\",\"id\":965,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"Jet ski tour in St. Petersburg FL with guide holding a horse conch in crystal clear water\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"caption_source\":\"custom\",\"caption\":\"Captain Mike holding a Florida horse conch during a guided jet ski rental tour in St. Petersburg, FL near Boca Ciega Bay.\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"42a70d0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/xtremestpete.com\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2025\\\/12\\\/jet-ski-couples-retreat-crystal-clear-waters-Egmont-scaled.jpg\",\"id\":967,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"Couple enjoying a jet ski tour in crystal clear baby blue waters near Egmont Key in St. Petersburg FL\\n\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"caption_source\":\"custom\",\"caption\":\"Many of our guests choose our St. Petersburg jet ski rentals specifically to explore areas like Egmont Key, where couples can ride together in calm, shallow, crystal-clear waters.\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"ea0f60d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/xtremestpete.com\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2025\\\/12\\\/jet-ski-tour-egmont-family-trip-beautiful-scaled.jpg\",\"id\":966,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"Family visiting from Germany enjoying a guided jet ski tour in St. Petersburg FL with calm clear waters\\n\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"caption_source\":\"custom\",\"caption\":\"We frequently welcome international families from Europe, including Germany, who choose our St. Petersburg jet ski rentals for a guided, safe, and memorable Florida water adventure.\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false}]","_elementor_page_settings":null}}